.\n\nO condomínio é completo com portaria 24 horas, salão de festas, espaço gourmet, brinquedoteca, piscina coberta e aquecida, quadra poliesportiva, bicicletário, salão de jogos e bosque\n\nUm imóvel completo, espaçoso e pronto para morar, ideal para quem busca qualidade de vida, amplitude e sofisticação em uma das melhores regiões de Curitiba.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/70116e9b-60e6-4250-a1ad-e8302fa65f35.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/37c6f314-23cd-4e7e-8447-611992099cae.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1680ff34-1159-45df-994e-118580a11a83.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ffe4a593-a446-4ba1-a8d9-8cce0e0a7d17.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/82e18189-beaf-4428-9371-9d035aee2a53.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/dd31f98a-6991-4d39-b3df-837e472c2b4a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/85669557-b7a2-435f-82ec-8288b303e0c5.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b5d4d4c9-56de-4719-8d85-71e37b8188dc.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d4393d58-d26d-4a78-be3e-e310bdab9985.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/67db0529-1bf7-4642-9433-59d9f8b0d262.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a66473680c82b356bc081a0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ec196be3-6548-4cbb-ae8a-778d554114c6.jpeg","ht